In the performance of his duties, the Secretary of Justice shall be assisted by a Technical Staff which shall have one Chief to be known as the Head Technical Assistant with a salary of twelve thousand pesos per annum, two assistant chiefs to be known as Senior Technical Assistants each of who shall receive eleven thousand four hundred pesos per annum, two Senior Special Assistants each of who shall receive ten thousand eight hundred pesos per annum and eight special assistants whose salaries shall be as follows:
(a) Two special assistant at ten thousand two hundred pesos each per annum;
(b) Two special assistants at nine thousand six hundred pesos each per annum;
(c) Two special assistants at eight thousand four hundred pesos each per annum;
(d) Two special assistants at seven thousand two hundred pesos each per annum;
